## 🔎 Insights (highlights)

- **Electronics** is the top category by both revenue and profit.
- **November** is the peak sales month — festive-season seasonality.
- **UPI** is the leading payment method by revenue.
- ~**93%** of customers are repeat buyers — retention is the biggest lever.
- **Electronics** absorbs the largest absolute discount value — margin risk to
  watch.

See `Documentation/Insights.md` for the full write-up and recommendations.

