## ⚙️ Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/Ecommerce-Sales-Dashboard.git
cd Ecommerce-Sales-Dashboard
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## ▶️ How to Run

```bash
cd Python

# 1. Generate the synthetic dataset
python 01_generate_dataset.py

# 2. Clean the data
python 02_data_cleaning.py

# 3. Run analysis, generate charts + summary report
python 03_analysis_and_kpis.py

# 4. Export star-schema CSVs for SQL / Power BI
python 04_export_sql_tables.py

# 5. Build the Excel workbook
python 05_build_excel.py

# 6. Generate the dashboard preview image
python 06_dashboard_mockup.py
```

**SQL:** run `SQL/01_create_database.sql`, then `SQL/02_insert_data.sql`
(or bulk-load the CSVs — instructions inside that file), then explore with
`SQL/03_analysis_queries.sql`.

**Power BI:** follow `PowerBI/PowerBI_Build_Guide.md` — load the data, build
the Date table, paste in the measures from `PowerBI/DAX_Measures.txt`, and
lay out the pages as described.

